      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Request deletion of your game account, cloud saves, summaries, leaderboard entries and applicable analytics records. Support verifies ownership before acting.\n\nDeleting cloud data can permanently remove progress. Signing out, clearing app storage and uninstalling do not delete cloud records. Your Google account is unaffected.\n\nPlayer ID: Unavailable \u2014 support can help you locate it.\n\nOpening email or the website does not submit a request or delete anything. Follow the instructions and send your request."
